Use
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Offbeat does not bypass DRM or any other copy protection, and does not
download content that is encrypted or restricted to paying users. Users are
responsible for downloading only content they have the right to save, such
as their own uploads, works in the public domain or under a license that
allows it (for example Creative Commons), or where the law of their country
allows a private copy, and for respecting the terms of the services they use.
